        <mxCell id="section_accept" value="P0 出门条件与非目标" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1740" width="2060" height="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0_list" value="P0 Before Formal External App Support&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. method / event / error schema registry&lt;br&gt;2. approval.respond protocol method + idempotency&lt;br&gt;3. events.subscribe protocol contract&lt;br&gt;4. local capability token&lt;br&gt;5. native EventSource + fetch stream auth&lt;br&gt;6. REST/BFF scope support&lt;br&gt;7. SDK/BFF legacy/debug denylist" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="1840" width="620" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="non_goals" value="Non-Goals&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Core 重构&lt;br&gt;• 业务 reference path 重迁移&lt;br&gt;• sibling service 内部实现&lt;br&gt;• 完整 Workflow Studio&lt;br&gt;• 完整 AgentTalkWindow" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="1840" width="560" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="challenge" value="Challenge To Previous Gap Shape&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 不再把历史路标放在主叙事&lt;br&gt;• 不再沿用六平面作为 V3.5 目标架构&lt;br&gt;• Product UI / External App 与 Gateway 分离&lt;br&gt;• Plane-1 Application Adaptation Layer 是 V3.5 主工作面&lt;br&gt;• 阶段影响范围不再误导为继续 Core 重构" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1440" y="1840" width="620" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="section_core_files" value="核心维护文件" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1">
